InfraEnv Curriculum uses two licenses so that software and educational works keep
clear, machine-readable boundaries.

Code, schemas, compiler logic, tests, and scripts are licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. See LICENSE-CODE.

Course prose, MDX lessons, scenarios, exercises, diagrams, and other educational
assets under content/ are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International. See LICENSE-CONTENT.

Unless a file states otherwise, that directory-based rule is authoritative.

